## Lab 3: Connected a Web App to the Network Using Point-to-Site VPN

- Configured Point-to-Site VPN on the VPN Gateway
  - Set address pool and certificate details
  - Configuration took approximately 35–40 minutes
- Deployed an Azure Web App and integrated it with VNet2
- Verified connectivity using Kudu CMD console:
  - `tcpping 172.18.0.4:3389` → VM2 ✅
  - `tcpping 172.17.0.4:3389` → VM1 ✅

### Reference
- [About Azure Point-to-Site VPN connections - Microsoft Learn](https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/vpn-gateway/point-to-site-about)

